# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values.

## Frontend (.env)

```
# Cloudflare Worker URL
# Local: http://localhost:8787
# Production: https://your-worker-url.workers.dev
VITE_WORKER_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web), untuk "Masuk dengan Google".
# Buat di Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client IDs.
# Tambahkan origin: http://localhost:5173 dan https://keyz-ai.vercel.app
# Catatan: tanpa ini, tombol login tidak dirender.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
```

## Worker (.dev.vars in worker/ directory)

```
# OpenAI API Key
# Get from: https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-YOUR_KEY_HERE

# Optional: OpenAI API URL (default: https://api.openai.com/v1)
OPENAI_API_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Optional: Model name (default: gpt-3.5-turbo)
# Options: gpt-3.5-turbo, gpt-4, gpt-4-turbo-preview
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-3.5-turbo
```

## Notes

- Never commit `.env` files with real keys
- Use Cloudflare secrets for production: `wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY`
- `.env.example` shows template (safe to commit)
